<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*!</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Your application to continue saving in the second pillar has been submitted.
          Contributions will start automatically on <strong>*|contributionStartDate|*</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          It's great that you're saving again! You can now make use of the second pillar's tax
          benefits and steadily grow your assets.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|IF:selectedTulevaStockFund|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will go to the <strong>Tuleva World Stocks Pension Fund</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSEIF:selectedTulevaBondFund|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will go to the <strong>Tuleva World Bonds Pension Fund</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSEIF:selectedOtherFund|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will go to <strong>*|selectedFundName|*</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSEIF:keptTulevaStockFund|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will again go to the <strong>Tuleva World Stocks Pension Fund</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSEIF:keptTulevaBondFund|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will again go to the <strong>Tuleva World Bonds Pension Fund</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSE:|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          Your contributions will go to the fund you saved in before. You can see your fund in
          <a href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/account">your Tuleva account</a>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|END:IF|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          *|IF:paymentRateChange|*You chose a <strong>contribution rate of *|paymentRate|*%</strong> of your
          gross salary.*|ELSE:|*Your second pillar <strong>contribution rate is *|paymentRate|*%</strong> of
          your gross salary.*|END:IF|* You can change your contribution rate every year until the
          end of November.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          You can use your second pillar savings from early retirement age, which is five years
          before the official retirement age (currently from age 60). The money you save is yours
          and can be inherited.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Your applications have been sent to Pensionikeskus and copies are attached to this
          email.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          If you change your mind, you can cancel the application in
          <a href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/account">your Tuleva account</a>. The last day to do
          so is *|cancellationDeadline|*.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./partials/contact_en.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">Happy saving!</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Tõnu Pekk<br />
          Founder and fund manager of Tuleva
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_second_pillar_rejoin_en.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
